Kathmandu, Nov 4 (PTI) Foreign Secretary Vikram Misri paid a courtesy call on Nepal’s Minister for Energy and Water Resources Biraj Bhakta Shrestha on Wednesday and discussed expanding cooperation in the energy sector, according to an official statement.

(function(v,d,o,ai){ai=d.createElement('script');ai.defer=true;ai.async=true;ai.src=v.location.protocol+o;d.head.appendChild(ai);})(window, document, '//a.vdo.ai/core/theprint/vdo.ai.js');

Misri is in Nepal on a two-day visit at the invitation of his Nepalese counterpart Amrit Bahadur Rai ahead of Prime Minister Balendra Shah’s forthcoming visit to India.
